2026-07-27T07:42:28.9733578Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:42:28.9734385Z i /tmp/RtmpahekJ5/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:42:28.9734844Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:42:28.9735308Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:42:28.9735952Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:42:28.9736584Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:42:28.9737516Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:42:28.9738218Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
